  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding support to the UN Global Programme to End Child Marriage.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding support to the UN Global Programme to End Child Marriage.   is a component of Accelerating Action to End Child Marriage Programme Phase 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;17,999,999. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Ending violence against women and girls, Basic life skills for adults, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Upper Secondary Education (modified and includes data from 11322).</narrative>
  </description>
